the-outlaw-camp-quest\">The Outlaw Camp Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>Until the Summer Update 2007, the bright sword was one of the best swords available on most worlds.</li>\n<li>With the spring patch 2012 the sprite of Bright Sword changed from <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bright Sword (Old)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bright_Sword_Old_22f2d7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> to <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bright Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bright_Sword_0b3ee5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Enraged%20Thorn%20Knight\">The Enraged Thorn Knight</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomission\">Gnomission</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomegate</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">6,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr>